            "review_title": "Review at Hoang Quan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "jenjen882\nDevon, United Kingdom14 contributions\n0\nTraditional cuisine\nAug 2016 • Couples\nGreat little restaurant if you want to sample local cuisine and fresh seafood. Reasonable priced and tasty. We enjoyed prawns cooked fresh to order and they were simply delicious. \n\nThe staff were friendly and helpful when coming to choose from the menu, the menu isn't in English and the staff speak limited English which meant we weren't 100% sure on what to expect but we weren't disappointed. \n\nNeed to make sure drinks were cold (maybe they were new into the fridge) as warm beer isn't too good!! Other than that worth a visit if you like fresh seafood and a taste of Vietnam.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 21, 2016\nvuhaihuyen1980\nDear jenjen882,\nThank you very much for reviewing our Hoang Quan restaurant.\nI am excited that we could make such a great impression on you with our fresh seafood and the ambiance of the restaurant.\nWe are looking forward to your continued patronage!\n\nKind regards!\nRead more\nWritten August 29, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
