            "review_text": "Delwyn T\n5 contributions\n0\nDelicious Vietnamese cuisine\nJun 2016 • Friends\nVery beautiful decor, nice ambience and good service. The food was so good. Fresh and delicious sea food. Try the \"Lẩu cua đồng\" dish, very delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 21, 2016\nvuhaihuyen1980\nDear Delwyn T Thank you for your visit at our Hoang Quan Restaurant and your feedback. We are delighted that we could impress you with our food quality and are looking forward to welcoming you soon again! Best regards\nWritten June 22, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
